        {
            "_id": "yPK80D4ILDtdCSAz",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg",
            "name": "Fire Wings",
            "sort": 500000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>When the fly is first encountered, the fly's wings burn with red flame. When the fly takes acid, cold, electricity, fire, sonic, or void damage, the fly's wing flame color changes depending on the type of damage dealt. If an attack or effect deals more than one of these damage types, the fly chooses which damage type affects their fire wings color. The fly gains resistance 15 to the damage type associated with its new fire wings color, and its eye beam ranged Strike deals that damage type. After 1 minute, the fly's fire wings revert to red flame. The damage type, fire color, and other effects of each fire wings color are:</p>\n<p><strong>Acid:</strong> Green fire. A creature that starts their turn in the fly's firelight aura takes @Damage[3d6[persistent,acid]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Cold:</strong> White fire. A creature that starts their turn in the fly's firelight aura takes a –15-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Electricity:</strong> Yellow fire. A creature that starts their turn in the fly's firelight aura is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Fire:</strong> Red fire. A creature that starts their turn in the fly's firelight aura takes @Damage[6d6[fire]] damage with a @Check[reflex|dc:32|basic] save.</p>\n<p><strong>Sonic:</strong> Purple fire. The fly emits a loud buzz. A creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Deafened] while in the fly's firelight aura.</p>\n<p><strong>Void:</strong> Black fire. The fly becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed] and loses its firelight aura until its Fire Wings change to a different color.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [
                    {
                        "alwaysActive": true,
                        "key": "RollOption",
